<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The tab bar at the bottom of the chat area holds two tabs: Status, and the one conversation you are reading. It is a switch between those two, not a list of everything you have open."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_star}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Switching Conversations")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Use the conversations sidebar on the left to move between channels and private messages. Click a conversation there and it takes the screen, replacing whichever one the tab bar was showing."
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "From the keyboard, Ctrl+Shift+] and Ctrl+Shift+[ walk through your joined channels and open private messages without touching the mouse."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_channel}>
  {dgettext("help_ui", "Switching Away vs Leaving")}
</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Reading something else does not leave the channel. A conversation you switch away from keeps receiving messages, keeps counting unread, and keeps flashing and playing its sound in the sidebar — you simply are not looking at it."
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "To actually leave, use the × on the tab, or right-click the channel in the sidebar and choose Leave Channel."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_ui", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="ui-conversations">{dgettext("help_ui", "Conversations")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="ui-status-tab">{dgettext("help_ui", "Status Tab")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="keyboard-shortcuts">{dgettext("help_ui", "Keyboard Shortcuts")}</.help_link>
</p>
